\": \"The quoted passage's document name, exactly as given, or empty\"},\n    \"quote\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Words copied exactly from one passage, or empty\"},\n    \"about_asker\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"yes\", \"no\"]}\n  }\n}";
